uration-300 \"></span></button></div></div></nav><section class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative pt-[40%] md:pt-[20%] xl:pt-[14%] 2xl:pt-[10%] pb-12 min-h-[55vh] sm:min-h-[50vh] md:min-h-[60vh] lg:min-h-[50vh] xl:min-h-[70vh] 2xl:min-h-[60vh] bg-cover bg-center\" style=\"background-image:url(/images/rn-infotech-17.webp)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/70\"></div><div class=\"w-full relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 md:gap-5 px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-24 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-white max-[380px]:text-xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-4xl 2xl:text-5xl  font-serif sm:text-3xl text-center max-[380px]:leading-10 leading-14 lg:leading-22 xl:leading-16 2xl:leading-22\">Mumbai&#x27;s Most Trusted Laptop Repair &amp; Services Centre</h1><p class=\"text-white/90 max-[380px]:mt-[-8px] mt-[-8px] max-[380px]:mb-4 mb-4 text-base font-sans font-medium md:text-lg lg:text-xl 2xl:text-2xl w-full sm:w-4/5 text-center\">Serving customers across Mumbai with honest, reliable and expert laptop solutions since 1990. We are not just a repair shop — we are your trusted tech partner.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 w-[70%] sm:w-auto\"><button class=\"max-sm:w-[100%] w-[240px] cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px] hidden sm:flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><img alt=\"Call icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/>Schedule Now</button><a href=\"tel:+91 88797 32594\" class=\"max-sm:w-[100%] w-[214px] font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px]  min-h-[50px] sm:hidden flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><img alt=\"Call icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/>Schedule Now</a><a href=\"/services\"><button class=\"max-sm:w-[100%] border border-light-blue cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-secondary hover:bg-[#00234c] text-light-blue rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Our Services</button></a></div></div></section><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-4 md:py-5 border-b border-gray-200 px-4\"><a class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a><img alt=\"Arrow Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-primary font-medium\">About Us</span></div><section class=\"bg-white p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row false items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center xl:items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center lg:text-left items-center lg:items-start\"><p class=\"label font-semibold text-center md:text-left tracking-widest\">Who We Are</p><h2 class=\"text-center lg:text-start max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif sm:text-3xl max-[380px]:leading-12 leading-13 sm:leading-11 lg:leading-16\">A Legacy of Trust &amp; Expertise</h2></div><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\">Established in 1990, RN Infotech is one of Mumbai&#x27;s most trusted and experienced laptop repair and computer service centres. Located at Tara Temple Lane, Leamington Road, Grant Road — we have been serving thousands of customers across Mumbai for over three decades.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\">What started as a small repair shop has grown into a one-stop destination for all laptop and computer needs. From quick repairs to second-hand laptop sales and genuine spare parts — we do it all under one roof.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\">Our team of skilled technicians and friendly staff are committed to delivering honest, high-quality service at affordable prices. We believe that every customer deserves the best — and that belief has been the foundation of our journey.</p></div></p><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center lg:justify-start sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full\"><a href=\"/services\"><button class=\"undefined cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Repair Your Machine</button></a></div></div><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Service Detail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-47.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-47.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-47.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-47.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-47.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-47.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-47.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-47.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-47.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-section-bg p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center xl:items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center lg:text-left items-center lg:items-start\"><p class=\"label font-semibold text-center md:text-left tracking-widest\">Our Story</p><h2 class=\"text-center lg:text-start max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif sm:text-3xl max-[380px]:leading-12 leading-13 sm:leading-11 lg:leading-16\">From Humble Beginnings to Mumbai&#x27;s Trusted Name</h2></div><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\">RN Infotech was founded in 1990 with a simple goal — to provide honest and reliable computer repair services to the people of Mumbai. Over the years, as technology evolved, so did we. We expanded our services, grew our team and built lasting relationships with thousands of customers across the city.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\">Today, RN Infotech stands as one of the most recognized names in laptop repair and services in Grant Road, Mumbai. Our journey has been built on hard work, dedication and an unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\">We are proud of where we started and excited about where we are headed — with plans to expand our services and reach even more customers across Mumbai in the coming years.</p></div></p><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center lg:justify-start sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full\"><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"undefined cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Contact Us</button></a></div></div><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Service Detail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-51.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-51.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-51.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-51.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-51.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-51.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-51.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-51.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-51.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--><footer><section class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 bg-gray-50 py-8 px-5 md:py-12 md:px-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16 2xl:px-35 2xl:py-15\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 items-start w-full lg:w-1/2 roun